y muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720900/extras/4529d9f8b4b0e4ed5946cd63403f0448.poster.avif?t=1755668396\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720900/extras/4529d9f8b4b0e4ed5946cd63403f0448.webm?t=1755668396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your units into trap detection specialists or crazed butchers. Identify traitors in your ranks. Bit by bit, uncover their personal stories and clues about what happened to each of the kingdoms you visit.<br><br>Like chess, without the dice.<br> </p>",
